  "finalText": "The bug was in the comparison operator. The code was using `token.exp < nowSeconds` to check expiry, but the spec says \"A token is considered expired the moment `exp` is reached.\" That means when expiration time equals the current time, it should already be expired. Changed it to `token.exp <= nowSeconds` and all five tests now pass.",
